          "title": "You'll want to know: घोलना",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "घोलना — gholnā — \"to dissolve; to stir in\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मीरा ने पानी में दवा घोली। Mīrā ne pānī meṁ davā gholī. Mira dissolved the medicine in water."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with ने (he or she …): उसने दवा घोली, usne davā gholī."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "घोलना (gholnā) is a tadbhava: CDIAL lists Hindi gholnā, \"to mix, dissolve, melt\", under Sanskrit ghōlayati (CDIAL 4526)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
